Scope note. This license covers the build script (`build_themes.py`) and the
generated theme JSON in `themes/`. Those files contain color values and role
mappings only — no code from the upstream color schemes. Each palette remains
the property of its authors under its own license, as recorded per theme in
`sources/theme-sources.json` (mostly MIT; Tokyo Night is Apache-2.0;
morhetz/gruvbox has no LICENSE file — only its hex values are reused here, see
README "来源与许可 / Sources & licenses").
